{"resourceIdentifier":"3223","resourceName":"CONSERVATION AND RESTORATION OF THE MANGROVE ECOSYSTEM IN THE GAMBIA THROUGH THE REDD+ MECHANISM","description":"The project is a grouped project that aims to generate greenhouse gas emission removals and reductions through mangrove reforestation and avoided degradation, including wetland restoration and conservation activities. The project area covers the entire mangrove landscape (both intact and degraded areas) of The Gambia, covering more than 100,000 ha, and project activities will be included gradually on the basis of appropriateness for rehabilitation and avoided degradation of mangrove, community involvement and financial resources available. The project area covers all mangrove regions of The Gambia. The regions are: - West Coast Region (WCR) - Lower River Region (LRR) - Greater Banjul Area (GBA) - North Bank Region (NBR) - Central River Region (CRR). In 2022, 240 hectares of mangrove was planted. In 2023, it is the ambition to plant 4000 hectares.","location":{"latitude":13.598878,"longitude":-14.947733},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-08-01","endExclusive":"2022-09-01","endInclusive":"2022-08-31"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3223"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"WCR, LRR, GBA, NBR and CRR"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Multiple Proponents"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"110002"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBCATERGORY_NAMES","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ARR; WRC"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"VM0007"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_ACREAGE",